  "id": "COMPOUND:22485 - PROTEIN:6150",
  "verbalization": "Javanicoside F appears to be a target of multiple entities, including 26S proteasome non-ATPase regulatory subunit 14 and Ataxin-2, which in turn are targets of other compounds. These entities ultimately share a common target: the H(+)/Cl(-) exchange transporter 3. This suggests a potential pathway where Javanicoside F may interact with these molecular entities, which then influence the activity of the H(+)/Cl(-) exchange transporter 3. The evidence points to a possible mechanism where Javanicoside F could modulate the activity of the proteasome or Ataxin-2, which in turn affects the transporter. The integration of these paths highlights a possible regulatory or functional link between Javanicoside F and the transporter, though the exact nature of the interaction remains to be elucidated.",
